    "coarse": "Compute unchanged original four-view consistency, keep every coarse detection, score, coordinate, order and origin. For non-road-image shapes use the complete original1..4 prefix.",
    "new_proposals": "Only non-interior-edge detections from supplemental small tiles. Transform to source pixel frame without changing scores or classes.",
    "coarse_veto": "Reject any supplemental proposal at IoU>.45 with any coarse result, regardless of class. Coarse boxes are never removed or replaced.",
    "support": "Require matching class and IoU>.45 against the same original proposal in at least two distinct supplemental views, including its own view. Count at most one best-confidence/lower-rank witness per view. No transitive chains.",
    "vehicle_ambiguity": "For proposed car/bus/truck, reject if any supplemental view contains an overlapping IoU>.45 conflicting car/bus/truck label. Other physically overlapping class pairs are not vetoed.",
    "ordering": "Sort supplemental proposals by score descending, class, left, view, rank. Apply classwise IoU>.45 NMS only between accepted additions. Append additions after the unmodified coarse result, up to total300.",
    "limits": "Existing complete<=16 view inventory, <=300 detections/view, coarse consistency work<=1400000. Additional IoU work<=27000000, complete no-clobber report<=4MiB. No partial success.",
    "interpretation": "Correlated crops of the same image provide support, not independent sensor evidence or calibrated probabilities."
  },
